{"strongs": "H1315", "word": "בָּֽשְׂמִת", "translit": "bos.mat", "root": "בשמת", "morph": "N:N-F-P", "pos": "proper name, feminine", "gloss": "perfume", "definition": "בָּֽשְׂמִת proper name, feminine ( perfume ?) — 1. Hittite woman, a wife of Esau Gen 26:34 ( P ); called daughter of Ishmael, and sister of Nebaioth Gen 36:3 (but due probably to R; this daughter of Ishmael is מַחֲלַת in Gen 28:9 P ); see also Gen 36:4 ; Gen 36:10 ; Gen 36:13 ; Gen 36:17 (all P ) ( ⅏ has מחלת throughout Gen 36 ). 2. daughter of Solomon, wife of Ahimaaz 1Kgs 4:15 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1364')\">BDB1364</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1315')\">H1315</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1363')\">BDB1363</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1365')\">BDB1365</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בָּֽשְׂמִת</bdbheb> <b>proper name, feminine</b> (<highlight>perfume </highlight>?) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> Hittite woman, a wife of Esau <ref ref=\"Gen 26:34\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,34)\">Gen 26:34</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); called daughter of Ishmael, and sister of Nebaioth <ref ref=\"Gen 36:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,36,3)\">Gen 36:3</ref> (but due probably to R; this daughter of Ishmael is <bdbheb>מַחֲלַת</bdbheb> in <ref ref=\"Gen 28:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,9)\">Gen 28:9</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); see also <ref ref=\"Gen 36:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,36,4)\">Gen 36:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 36:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,36,10)\">Gen 36:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 36:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,36,13)\">Gen 36:13</ref>; <re